{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れちまぁ´◡`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夜ご飯にカレーライスを食べました*\\(^o^)/*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「福神漬けって何からできているのだろう...？何で福神漬けって名前なんだろう...？」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとふと疑問に思ったのです。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すぐにインターネットで調べてみると、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「福神漬けとは、大根・なす・かぶ・なた豆・しその実・うり・れんこんなど、7種類の材料を細かく刻み、みりんじょうゆに漬け込んだもの」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとでてきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福神漬って日奈の中では名詞みたいになってました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お漬物ということはわかっていましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7種類も材料が入っていたなんて気付いてなかった（；゜０゜）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"7種類もの材料でできてるから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七福神ヾ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福神漬けっていうのかぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるほど！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなに身近なことでも、ちゃんと知らないことが、まだまだ沢山有りそう..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しいことを学べた1日でした´◡`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/06/25/6725719/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぇいっヾ(｡･ω･｡) ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/06/25/6725719/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑この間、せっちゃんと遊んだときに食べたデザート♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食パン1巾の量だったので、せっちゃんと半分個こしました(*´艸｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、せっちゃんにお洋服をたくさん頂いたのです❀(*´◡`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに上の写真のお洋服も、せっちゃんからもらったもの♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いお洋服ばかりで..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日奈は幸せものだぁ´◡`"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからたくさん着させてもらいます♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/06/25/6725719/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっちゃんありがとう♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きよぉーん(*´艸｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月24日 てらまさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月26日 にこやんさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月27日 菜奈さん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月27日 たいよーさん】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【6月27日 みゅうみゅう☆】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"☆Happy Birthday☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにとって、素敵な1年になりますように...＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/0